  "notes": "{応|こた}える means to respond to or live up to something.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: Intransitive ({自動詞|じどうし})\n- Pattern: Xに{応|こた}える (respond to X)\n\nDISTINCTION FROM {答|こた}える:\n- {応|こた}える: respond to (expectations, requests)\n- {答|こた}える: answer (questions, quizzes)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {期待|きたい}に{応|こた}える: meet expectations\n- {要望|ようぼう}に{応|こた}える: respond to requests\n- {要求|ようきゅう}に{応|こた}える: meet demands\n- {声援|せいえん}に{応|こた}える: respond to cheers\n- {信頼|しんらい}に{応|こた}える: live up to trust\n\nASPECT (ている):\n- {応|こた}えている: is responding/meeting\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {答|こた}える: to answer (a question)\n- {対応|たいおう}する: to deal with, handle\n- {満|み}たす: to satisfy, fulfill",
